  "body": "Replaces #2640 with the same Hurco commit (`4cd8bdae2`, cherry-picked unchanged) on a branch straight off `main`. #2640 was stacked on the Grbl post draft #2506, so it could not merge before #2506; this one does not need it.\n\n## Latest review fixes\n\nHead: `ed04216dc468f9880dea0651c813b5762c401488`.\n\n- Finding 1: Cancel active cycles before travel. Seat each hole at the section hop before descent to R. Refuse missing hops.\n- The `cycle_hop` suite includes Hurco. It checks back-to-back cycles and cycles after probing, feeds, and arcs.\n- Finding 3: Set the vendor to `Camcraft`. `hurco_post_vendor_is_camcraft` pins the value.\n- All 30 focused tests passed. Cycle seating, feed tracking, arc tracking, and vendor mutations failed their pins. Restored fixes passed.\n- Update the synthesized Hurco golden for safe hops. Conformance passed all 7 tests.\n- Clippy for `camcraft-post` and `camcraft-app`, all targets with warnings denied: passed.\n- Quick gate ran 648 steps. After the golden update, only `continuous_4axis_part` remains red: `/version: 71 != 70`.\n- Finding 2 remains open. No simulator access, load results, or path comparisons are available. Issue #2573 remains incomplete.\n\nRe-checked on this branch: `camcraft-post --test script_hurco_winmax` 11 passed; `camcraft-app --test hurco_winmax_post` 7, `post_spindle_rule_all` 2, `conformance` 5 passed.\n\n---\n\n## What changed\n\n- Add clean-room built-in post `Hurco WinMax (NC)` in `assets/posts/hurco-winmax.cps`.\n- Add clean-room 3-axis VMC definition `Hurco VM10i` in `assets/machines/hurco-vm10i.mch`.\n- Register both entries in `BUILTINS`, `MACHINES`, and `embedded()` inside `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs`.\n- Emit Hurco WinMax ISNC blocks (`G20`/`G21` unit block, `O0001`..`O9999`, `G90 G17 G94 G54..G59 G40 G49 G80`, `G54.1 P1`..`P93`, decimal-second `P` dwell on `G04`/`G82`/`G89`, `G84.2`/`G84.3` rigid tapping and `G84` floating tapping, `G68`/`G69` rotation, `G31` probing with `G10 L2`, no `G91.1`).\n- Record design decisions in `docs/decisions/2573-hurco-winmax-post.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nNo built-in post processor or machine definition existed for Hurco WinMax 3-axis NC/ISO (ISNC) mills.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins:\n  - `crates/post/tests/hurco_winmax_post.rs` (8/8 pass; red before fix `0/7`: `hurco-winmax.cps` missing): multi-op contour/arc/drill/peck/tap across two tools and two offsets, `G20`/`G21` and `EndUnits`, decimal-second `P` dwell, `G84.2`/`G84.3`/`G84`, `G54`..`G59` and `G54.1 P1`..`P93`, `G28`/`G53` safe retract, `O0001`..`O9999` bounds, `G41`/`G42` compensation, `G68`/`G69` rotation, `G31` probing, smoothing note, named refusals, and a strict documented WinMax ISNC word-set allowlist check over posted programs and all 21 `.nc` goldens.\n  - `crates/app/tests/hurco_winmax_post.rs` (2/2 pass; red before fix `0/2`: missing registry entries): checks `BUILTINS`/`MACHINES` registration, `post_serves`, VM10i parse, full ECS contour/pocket/drill/peck/rigid-tap workflow across two tools and `G54`/`G55`, plus `G54.1 P1`.\n  - Cross-post suites updated and green: `conformance` (7/7), `machine` (33/33), `machine_library` (11/11), `post_spindle_rule_all` (5/5), `bore_cycle` (9/9), `comp_plane` (3/3), `decimal_point_fanuc_family` (3/3), `declared_options` (3/3), `end_units` (3/3), `first_traverse_clearance_fanuc_family` (9/9), `radius_arcs` (7/7), `script_hurco_winmax` (11/11).\n- Mutations (each verified RED when reverted/weakened, GREEN when restored):\n  - `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs` reverted to `HEAD`: `0/1` (`hurco_winmax_post_and_vm10i_are_registered_and_serve_mill` fails), restored `1/1`.\n  - `oWord()` `1..=9999` check removed: `0/1` (`extended_work_offsets_and_safe_retract_and_o_word` fails), restored `1/1`.\n  - `workOffsetMax` raised and `> 99` guard removed: `0/1` (`extended_work_offsets_and_safe_retract_and_o_word` fails), restored `1/1`.\n  - `G53` missing `safeRetractZ` check removed: `0/1` (`extended_work_offsets_and_safe_retract_and_o_word` fails), restored `1/1`.\n  - `rigidTapping === false` check removed: `0/1` (`tapping_modes_and_rigid_tapping_guard` fails), restored `1/1`.\n  - Cycle illegal dwell `rawDwell > 0` check removed: `0/1` (`cycles_refuse_illegal_dwell_and_tilt_and_zero_spindle` fails), restored `1/1`.\n  - `tiltOk()` 3-axis guard bypassed: `0/1` (`cycles_refuse_illegal_dwell_and_tilt_and_zero_spindle` fails), restored `1/1`.\n- Gate & lint:\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 643 step(s), 0 failed (57.0 min).\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: 0 warnings, exit 0.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- Added 14 new `conformance` goldens under `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/hurco-winmax/*.nc` (13 ops) and `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/synth_hurco-winmax.nc`.\n- Added 11 new `script_hurco_winmax` recorded goldens under `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/hurco-winmax/` (7 `.nc`, 4 `.refusal`).\n- No existing `.nc` or `.cl` goldens changed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nLatest review finding 2 remains open. The required simulator load results and path comparisons are not available. Issue #2573 remains incomplete.\n\nPrograms were not verified on the community owner's WinMax `09.01.393.30` simulator or on a physical Hurco control. Behaviour follows published Hurco WinMax Mill NC documentation (`704-0116-101`, `support.hurco.com`) and public Hurco VM10i specifications.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nThis PR branches from `main`. It touches these functions and tables:\n- `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs` (`BUILTINS`, `MACHINES`, `embedded`)\n- `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs` (`POSTS`, `EXTENSIONS`)\n- `crates/app/tests/machine.rs` (`every_shipped_machine_mounts_and_speaks_its_declaration`)\n- `crates/app/tests/post_spindle_rule_all.rs` (`POSTS`)\n- `crates/post/tests/bore_cycle.rs` (`NO_DWELL`)\n- `crates/post/tests/comp_plane.rs` (`POSTS`)\n- `crates/post/tests/decimal_point_fanuc_family.rs` (`MILL_POSTS`)\n- `crates/post/tests/declared_options.rs` (`shipped_milling_posts_declare_valid_option_schemas`)\n- `crates/post/tests/end_units.rs` (`writing_mill_posts_emit_end_unit_word_before_program_end`)\n- `crates/post/tests/first_traverse_clearance_fanuc_family.rs` (`POSTS`)\n- `crates/post/tests/radius_arcs.rs` (`RADIUS_POSTS`)\n\nOpen PRs `#2515` and `#2310` also touch `posting_files.rs` / `conformance.rs` / `machine.rs` and were already conflicting with `main` at Step 2.\n\nChangelog: Add built-in Hurco WinMax (NC) ISNC 3-axis mill post and Hurco VM10i machine.\nRefs #2573\n\n\n",
